  "exercise_count": 0,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "自然界和工程中有许多球形或近似球形的物体，例如恒星、行星和雨滴，也有许多近似平面的表面。曲面上一小块区域，在所考察的尺度足够小时，也可以近似看成平面。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "在自然界和工程技术中，有很多球形或接近球形的物体(恒星、行星、雨滴等)，也有不少是平面物体. 此外，任何表面的很小一段，也可以近似看作为平面.",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**球面的电场** 考虑半径为$R_0$的孤立金属球。没有外加电场、周围介质均匀时，静电平衡下球面上的电荷均匀分布。球外的电场线沿半径方向分布，图125用带正电的球说明这一结构。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "**球面的电场** 电荷在半径为$R_0$的金属球面上的分布是均匀的. 球面的电力线是沿着球的半径的延长线(图125).",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "球外的电场线形状与位于球心、带相同总电荷的点电荷相同，见图126。场线形状相同本身并不能确定场强大小；还必须使用相同总电荷和球对称条件。因此，在均匀的周围介质中，球外场强可由点电荷公式(8-13)确定。原书写作$r\\geq R_0$；在球面处，以下公式表示从外侧趋近表面时的场强。在国际单位制中，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#7",
        "p0176#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "请注意：球外面电力线的分布跟点电荷电力线的分布是完全一样的(图126). 如果电力线的分布一致，则场强也应当一致. 因此，距球心 $r\\geq R_0$ 处的场强，也用放在球心处的点电荷场强公式(8-13)来确定. 在国际单位制中，",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-125",
      "label": "图125",
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图125",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图125",
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "图125",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-126",
      "label": "图126",
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图126",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图126",
      "printed_page": 166,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "图126",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$。 (8-16)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$E=\\frac{|q|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r^2}$. (8-16)",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "静电平衡时，金属球内部，即$r<R_0$处，场强等于零。这里的$\\varepsilon$表示周围介质的相对介电常数，$\\varepsilon_0$是真空介电常数。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "金属球内部($r<R_0$)的场强等于零.",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**平面的电场** 均匀带电表面的等面积区域带有相同电荷。原书以每平方厘米所带的电荷说明这种均匀性；单位面积上的电荷称为电荷面密度$\\sigma$。若电荷$q$均匀分布在面积$S$上，则",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "**平面的电场** 设每平方厘米表面**带有相同的电荷** $\\sigma$. 于是，表面是均匀带电表面. 单位面积所带的电荷，叫做电荷的面密度. 如果电荷 $q$ 均匀地分布在面积 $S$ 上，则",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sigma=\\frac{q}{S}$。 (8-17)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\sigma=\\frac{q}{S}$. (8-17)",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "考虑两侧处于同一种均匀介质中的理想无限大均匀带电薄平面。其电场线彼此平行，并垂直于平面，见图127。每一侧的电场都是匀强电场，场强大小与到平面的距离无关；两侧场强大小相等、方向相反。正电荷的场线离开平面，负电荷的场线指向平面。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "无限大均匀带电平面的电力线是彼此平行的，且垂直于平面(图127).无限大平面的电场是匀强电场，即空间中的所有点的场强都是相同的，与到平面的距离无关. 它的量值由 $\\sigma$ 来确定.",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-127",
      "label": "图127",
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "球面或点电荷场强随$q/r^2$所表示的电荷与距离关系变化；无限大平面的场强大小则与电荷面密度的绝对值成正比。按上述理想模型计算，可得到以下结果。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "跟球面或点电荷的场强与 $q/r^2$ 成正比相类似，平面的场强与 $\\sigma$ 成正比. 根据计算求出比例系数，得出下列结果：",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图127",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图127",
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "图127",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在国际单位制中，$\\sigma$用库仑每平方米表示，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "在国际单位制中，",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E=\\frac{|\\sigma|}{2\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}$。 (8-18)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$E=\\frac{|\\sigma|}{2\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}$， (8-18)",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在原书使用的静电单位制中，必须使用该单位制的电荷面密度和场强单位，不能把国际单位制数值直接代入，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "在静电单位制中，",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E=\\frac{2\\pi|\\sigma|}{\\varepsilon}$。 (8-19)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "$E=\\frac{2\\pi|\\sigma|}{\\varepsilon}$. (8-19)",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现实中不存在无限大的平面。对于有限的均匀带电平面，如果观察点远离边缘，而且到平面的距离远小于平面的横向尺寸，就可以近似使用无限大平面的结果。近边缘处不能使用这一近似。各小块电荷的场强随距离平方的倒数衰减，远处边缘区域对所考察点的影响较小。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 167,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0176#14",
        "p0177#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "无限大的平面是没有的. 但是，如果平面的尺寸与从某点到它的距离相比是很大的，则该点的场强实际上是和无限大平面在该点所产生的场强是一样的. 由于很小的单位电荷的场强与距离的平方成反比，所以，平面边缘部分对场强的影响是很小的.",
      "changes": [
        "modernized"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
